/E (Khan Saab, born Imran Khan, is a distinctive voice in contemporary Punjabi music, known for his soulful vocals and emotionally charged, Sufi-influenced sound. He began his singing journey with Main Nahi Peenda in 2010 and rose to prominence with songs such as Rim Jhim, Jee Kharda, Sajna, Narazgi and Zindagi Tere Naal.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
