182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (His musical identity draws deeply from the works of legends such as Ustad Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan, while his collaborations and contemporary approach have helped bring a traditional Sufi sensibility to a younger audience. With a voice marked by its depth, vulnerability and unmistakable Punjabi character, Khan Saab has established himself as a celebrated singer and songwriter in the Punjabi music scene, with a growing presence across live performances and popular culture.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
